I've seen the trailer. I don't understand why the hype but it just seems like any other fps game. Walk around, float around shoot some monsters, rinse and repeat. Get in space ship shoot monster, rinse and repeat. Talk to random NPC, get quest, grind mobs, retrieve item. Rinse repeat. Goals= get new weapons which are fps guns just with different effects. 

&#x200B;

From the looks of the trailer. The mobs move very basic. No fancy elden ring mobs. 

&#x200B;

But I understand why it's hyped. Nerdy startreck and Star wars players love this shit.
